# Kagome J1-J2 Heisenberg, 36 sites (2,2),(-2,4), S_z = 1, the block at the momentum of the star of six (little group: one
# mirror); 358 million states.  Its matrix elements do not fit on one 80 GB card; through layouts of the vector one product
# takes 0.15 s on an H100 (0.80 s for the sub engine computing them on the fly).
lattice kagome a1=2,2 a2=-2,4
couplings J1=1 J2=0.12
sector Sz=1 k=0.3333333333333333,1.6666666666666667 irrep=X0
solve engine=layout device=gpu time_product=1
